Package: nBootstrap
Title: Nonparametric Bootstrap Confidence Intervals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Nonparametric bootstrap helpers: percentile, bias-corrected,
    and bias-corrected and accelerated confidence intervals from a matrix
    of draws, and nonparametric bootstrap and jackknife half-vectorized
    covariance matrices computed in C++.
    PCCI(), BCCI(), and BCaCI() are exported; the internal workers are
    copied by other projects.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/nBootstrap,
        https://ijapesigan.github.io/nBootstrap/
